            "autoplay": false,
            "autoplay_speed": 5,
            "display_arrows": false,
            "display_dots": true,
            "text_1": "<p>I used to be the young woman who made things happen. Then one day I looked up and realized I'd become someone who just... exists. Haritaki gave me back my drive. I'm building again. Creating again. LIVING again at 71.</p>",
            "author_1": "Monique J. [stars]",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/8c374657-a516-441b-8643-ef0c6615165b.jpg",
            "text_2": "<p>I felt spiritually dead. No dreams. No intuition. Just... nothing. Three weeks in, I had my first vivid dream in years. I woke up crying. Something was unblocking.</p>",
            "author_2": "Hanna K. [stars]",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/638b9bfe-bbed-42b8-b992-ed5552f0dc56.jpg",
            "text_3": "<p>I told my wife I felt like I was watching my life through a window. Like I was there but not really THERE. Now? I'm finally on the other side of that glass. Present. Alive.</p>",
            "author_3": "Robert T. [stars]",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/6f02e9d9-fbbe-4ce2-be49-cf52c00a284c.webp",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 15
